---
title: Current action flow — delivery and current evidence are separate
---
sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Physical or semantic input through one writer
  accDescr: The player chooses an intent and informing source. The writer and controller capture actual dispatch evidence. Physical input permits visual drift under unchanged custody; semantic shortcuts retain their equivalence checks. Native commit validates the actual receiver and authority. A correlated ACK settles delivery once as historical evidence, never objective success or current authority. A separate current snapshot can support the next decision. If it is absent or aged after direct input, the player must explicitly Observe before another input. Original scope and costs remain. Unknown delivery freezes input and is never blindly replayed.
  participant P as Designated player
  participant C as Writer and controller
  participant B as Native bridge
  participant G as Game engine
  P->>C: Intent, informing source and limits
  C->>B: Observe actual dispatch boundary
  B-->>C: Fresh preflight capture and custody
  Note over P,C: Physical input permits drift<br/>Semantic shortcuts check<br/>source equivalence
  C->>B: Input, actual frame, identity and expiry
  Note over B: Check live receiver, custody and revocation
  B->>G: Normal engine or widget input
  Note over C,G: A later Pause cannot undo committed input
  alt Correlated terminal ACK
    G-->>B: Rendered result or prompt
    B-->>C: ACK and its historical after-frame
    C->>C: Settle known delivery once<br/>Read independent current snapshot
    alt Fresh eligible current capture
      C-->>P: Result, ACK source and actual current source
    else Absent or aged current after direct input
      C-->>P: Partial result, explicit Observe needed
      P->>C: Observe under the original owned scope
      C->>B: Capture fresh visible evidence
      B-->>C: Fresh current capture
      C-->>P: New binding or local macro closure
    end
    Note over P,C: Interpret effects from evidence<br/>Delivery is not success<br/>No automatic key or retargeting<br/>Original limits remain
  else Deadline or unresolved delivery
    C-->>P: Outcome unknown, input frozen
    Note over C,G: Collect and reconcile, never replay blindly
  end
